TOP IMPORTANCE
- GAME MANAGER
  - Runs all managers
- DISPLAY MANAGER
  - Keeps track of menus and current contracts, events and player stats
  - Displays all relevant information

STEP 2
- Audio Manager
  - Play and store sounds
- Randomiser
  - Create a series of random contracts and events
- Controls
  - Primarily mouse based gameplay
  - Possibly basic keyboard or controller support

STEP 3
- Player
  - Stats for each player
- Artefacts
  - Folder of artefacts with unqiue executes
  - Player id integer to track if its chosen and by who
- Events
  - Hard coded classes which work similarly to zombies.cpp
- Contracts
  - Object which selects a positive and negative effect to give the player

STEP 4 -
- Setting Reader and Writer
  - Store setting preferances into txt file
  - Read the settings when game launches and apply accordingly
- Leaderboard
  - Take in co-op score after game is finished
